Month end closing for the stipulated legal entities which include, journal requests, provisions, cycle runs etc.
Year end closing for the stipulated legal entities;
Cost centre analysis, planning, and forecasting;
Business plan preparation;
General support to controllers as required;
Support lead controller with standardization, automation and digitization, also with preparations for data mining, testing and presentations.
Required skills;
