Fluent in English, ability to speak, read and write on a professional level;
Competent in MS Office Tools (Outlook, Excel, Word, Power Point etc.);
Experience on SAP would be an advantage
Personal Characteristics;
Reliable;
Ability to work independently and in a team;
Detail oriented;
Deadline driven;
Solution and customer oriented;
Ability to work under pressure
Qualifications
A completed Degree / Diploma in Management Accounting / Cost Accounting or related field

