About The Job
The CSIR has a vacancy for an
IT Support and Systems Engineers
in the Technology for Special Operations (TSO) impact area, within the Defence and Security cluster. The incumbent will be responsible for installing, configuring, and maintaining computer and Data Centre infrastructures, software, systems, networks, servers, firewalls, printers and peripherals. This position is based in Stellenbosch.
