Key Responsibilities
Research and implement solutions to software and hardware issues spanning Endpoints, peripherals, networks, Data Centre, and Servers;
Manage (direct involvement) requests, incidents, events, and changes cradle to grave;
Research, diagnose, troubleshoot and identify solutions to resolve system issues;
Coordinate the implementation of support and maintenance projects and Service Level Agreement’s (SLA) for the different systems in accordance with governance practices, across different support teams;
Monitor services to determine the possible need for intervention to inform the end-user training focus;
Communicate closely with all support teams and portfolios to ensure resolution of referred incidents within SLA;
Monitor and administer capacity demand of ICT infrastructure services to ensure adequate real-time performance in accordance with expected business outcomes, articulated in SLAs;
Adhere to policies, procedures, standards, and practices to ensure compliance to regulatory and Governance requirements, through the provision of services;
