Maintain alignment to quality standards (e.g. Cobit, ISO), best practices (ITIL Service Management), governance and legislative requirements (e.g. Information Security, POPI, ECT Act.) to ensure a high level of customer satisfaction;
Manage hardware life cycles to ensure hardware remains in warranty with Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM);
