System and user administration (e.g. License management, Access management, system and user support);
Respond to data centre service outage and other problems to ensure speedy resolution per SLA;
Monitor, maintain, support and report on services/systems availability and capacity of ICT infrastructure and endpoints to ensure availability and accessibility of services per SLA;
Coordinate and ensure that adequate training is provided for users;
Act as liaison between users and information technology department on problem areas, improvement and propose enhancements;
Responsible for key service/s or product/s and ensures efficient and sufficient delivery, monitoring and support;
Provide solutions to problems.
